 "title": "Rupaya Rs 90 se Rs 96 kyun gira? 3 wajah | Case Study #shorts",
 "description": "Jan 2026 mein 1 dollar ~Rs 90, May mein record Rs 96.47, aur kal Rs 94+. Rupaya kyun gira? Case study.\n\n- Wajah 1: tel - Bharat 88%+ crude import karta hai, payment dollar mein\n- Wajah 2: videshi niveshakon ne arbon dollar nikale\n- Wajah 3: mushkil waqt mein mazboot dollar\n- RBI ne dollar bechkar girawat dheemi ki\n- Asar: phone, laptop, videsh padhai mehenge; IT, exporters, remittance parivaron ko fayda\n\nSources:\nhttps://www.dtnext.in/news/business/oil-surge-over-west-asia-crisis-to-sustained-fpi-outflows-whats-behind-the-rupees-fall\nhttps://gulfnews.com/business/markets/rupee-weakens-as-5-reasons-from-oil-to-outflows-build-pressure-1.500484536\nhttps://www.deccanherald.com/business/markets/rupee-falls-33-paise-to-close-at-9404-against-us-dollar-4215907\nhttps://www.outlookbusiness.com/markets/the-96-question-how-a-weak-rupee-is-creating-winners-and-losers-on-d-street\n\nPhotos (Wikimedia Commons):\nFile:Coins of the Indian rupee.png | ChiK | CC BY-SA 4.0\nFile:One Rupee Indian coins.JPG | Reserve Bank of India / Kshitij Gupta | CC BY-SA 3.0\nFile:Indian one Rupee coin (YS).JPG | YVSREDDY | CC BY-SA 3.0\nFile:Solomon Sea (oil tanker), in the Solent, England.jpg | ITookSomePhotos | CC BY-SA 4.0\nFile:Oil tanker, gas tanker in the high sea Refinery Industry cargo ship (52848038105).jpg | Jernej Furman from Slovenia | CC BY 2.0\nFile:Oil tankers, Tranmere Oil Terminal (geograph 4548088).jpg | El Pollock | CC BY-SA 2.0\nFile:Worlds heaviest reactor erection for RUF unit at Vizag Refinery Modernization Project.jpg | Rajiv Nair EIL | CC BY-SA 4.0\nFile:BSE - Bombay Stock Exchange Building.jpg | Niyantha Shekhar | CC BY 2.0\nFile:\"CMA CGM WAGNER\" IMO- 9280665 - CONTAINER SHIP 65247 tons, Mumbai - India. (13906868747).jpg | Andrew Thomas from Shrewsbury, UK | CC BY-SA 2.0\nFile:India (ship, 2003) 001.jpg | kees torn | CC BY-SA 2.0\nFile:Laptop on desk book stacks (Unsplash).jpg | freddie marriage fredmarriage | CC0\n\n#shorts #casestudy #rupee #